Modifications
-------------
Changes have been made from the original. This fork is maintained by
CK-AT (https://github.com/CK-AT) and adds, among other things:

  - Native flight-sim support (Microsoft Flight Simulator via SimConnect,
    X-Plane via DataRefs), including helicopter and aircraft force models.
  - A node-based signal-processing graph engine in the SimHub plugin.
  - Tiered Hardware -> Profile -> User configuration with per-function overrides.
  - New subprojects not present upstream: XPlanePlugin/,
    GripController/.
  - ESP32/ESP32-S3 firmware reworked with multi-axis CAN sync, A6 servo protocol
    work, sensorless homing and Wi-Fi OTA.

The full history of modifications is recorded in this repository's Git log.

